        <body>
            <div xml:id="d508">

                <pb facs="0457" n="341" xml:id="pg341"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/864.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Smith.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 1, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Government formed by General Oreste Zamor, as constitutional President duly
                    elected by the Haitian Congress, being now fully established in power with the
                    assent of the people, you are instructed to recognize it.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
